== Overview ==
The '''Camo Toilet''' is an [[Uncommon]] unit added inside of the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]], and it can be obtained by summoning it from a [[Noob Toilet Crate]].

== Appearance ==
The toilet has a military look with the camouflage background on the toilet. It also seems to be on a tank, with multiple blasters, including a beret launcher in the back.

==Obtainment==
To obtain the '''Camo Toilet''' you can summon it from a [[Noob Toilet Crate]], or get it by [[Trading]], or buying it from the [[Marketplace]].

