==Trivia==

*'''Camo Toilet''' is the second  most common unit in the [[Noob Toilet Crate]].
*His lv1 is based of [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Camo_Skibidi_Toilet Camo Skibidi Toilet], his lv2 is [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Giant_Camo_Skibidi_Toilet Giant Camo Toilet], his lv3 is [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Armed_Camo_Skibidi_Toilet Armed Camo Toilet] and his lv4 is [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Bill_Tank_Skibidi_Toilet Bill Tank Toilet].
*He is based of [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Camo_Skibidi_Toilet Camo Skibidi Toilet] and its variants in Skibidi Toilet series.




